<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A9B06018" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Back Panel Removal and Installation
</title>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0110.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "77.298mm" ver = "01" gw = "358" gh = "203"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9B06018001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Unscrew 4 bolts.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove back panel.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0111.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "182.656mm" ver = "03" gw = "469" gh = "501"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.394in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "6.693in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
<symbol name = "MANOTE" width = "5.132mm" height = "3.048mm"/>
1.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
This symbol indicates that rear floor rear panel is replaced at the same time.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
<symbol name = "MANOTE" width = "5.132mm" height = "3.048mm"/>
2.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
This symbol indicates that quarter-pillar outer panel and wheel house outer panel are replaced at the same time.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9B06018002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s). 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9B04005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install back panel and jacking mount reinforcement.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld or plug weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten 4 bolts to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0112.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "189.348mm" ver = "03" gw = "469" gh = "520"/>
